 "splits_not_obtainable": {
  "moryossef2019_srivatsan2022": "Srivatsan & Berg-Kirkpatrick, 'Checklist Models for Improved Output Fluency in Piano Fingering Prediction' (ISMIR 2022) state they 'use alternate splits created by [Moryossef et al. 2019] which increase the relative size of the train and validation sets'. Neither paper publishes the file lists and the referenced code (github.com/AmitMY/piano-fingering-extraction) is gone (HTTP 404). Moryossef et al. 2023 (arXiv:2303.03745) instead keep Nakamura's split and move one (unnamed) training piece to a development set."
 }
